              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "You can define the roles using a named attribute instead, which is the longhand syntax for adding roles to an element. When using this syntax, add the attribute name "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "role"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " followed by the equals sign ("
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "="
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ") then the role name or names to any position in the block attribute list."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "listing",
                "id": "ex-block-formal",
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "[role=rolename]\n****\nThis is a sidebar with one role assigned to it, rolename.\n****"
                  }
                ],
                "language": "asciidoc",
                "roles": [],
                "title": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Sidebar block with a role assigned using the formal syntax"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Separate multiple role values using spaces. Since the value has spaces, it’s easier to read if enclosed in quotes, though the quotes are not strictly required."
